            "content": {
              "*/*": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TimeResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Returns the 2b2t world time in ticks (0 - 24000).\n\nTo determine the real-time 2b2t world time, interpolate between lastUpdated and the current real world time.\n\nMC and real world time conversion help: https://minecraft.wiki/w/Daylight_cycle#Conversions\n1 minecraft tick = 50 ms real world time\n\nDaytime starts at 6:00 (0 ticks) and night begins at 18:00 (12000 ticks)\n"
          },
